OL,3,GNEWSASchool with over 1,000 pupils
OL,4,Aevacuated over hoax bomb threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school of more than 1,000 pupils was
OL,7,Fevacuated after a hoax bomb threat was
OL,8,Fmade.
OL,10,FSt Cuthbert's Roman Catholic High
OL,11,FSchool was put into lockdown after the
OL,12,Fbomb call at 08:55 BST and staff
OL,13,Fdialled 999.
OL,15,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said it
OL,16,Finvestigated but found it was a hoax.
OL,18,FThe school, which has more than 1,100
OL,19,Fpupils, has been closed for the day.
OL,20,FGMP said it was investigating.
